            "review_title": "Review at Maison Gio Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ryan L\nSeoul, South Korea10 contributions\n0\nIt was truly an unforgettable experience.\nOct 2025 • Family\nIf you ever visit Phu Quoc, this is an absolute must-go place.\nOur family first came here just for lunch, but we were so impressed by the amazing facilities that we came back later in our trip just to enjoy the water activities.\n\nWe joined a hopping tour for snorkeling, rode on a jet boat, and experienced a giant inflatable playground floating on the sea.\n\nThe owner and staff were incredibly kind — they treated us like family and took great care of us.\nEvery corner of the place was spotless, and the food was excellent. We could eat here with complete confidence, and during our two visits, we ended up having three meals here in total.\n\nIf you want a real travel experience rather than just killing time on an ordinary tour, this is the place to be!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIt’s great to visit for the food, but make sure to spend a whole day here!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 7, 2025",
